      "title": "Store Associate",
      "description": "<p>Help customers find the right gear for the trail, run the till and keep the floor stocked at our Commercial Street store.</p><ul><li>Product advice and fitting</li><li>Receiving and stocking</li><li>Opening and closing shifts</li></ul><p>Staff discount and paid time off for guided trips.</p>",
